 there were good comics that were  also those things heck the entire trend  was kicked off by Watchmen and The Dark  Knight Returns which are both definitely  all three of those things and are also  both great the bad comics of the 90s  were bad because they were badly drawn  poorly thought-out and shallow because  they were being made by creators who are  more interested in jumping on a  bandwagon then doing their own thing and  finding their own unique voice and if  that bandwagon  instead of being dark edgy and gritty  had been rainbow colors and the power of  friendship they would have jumped on  that instead and done it just as badly  those were the strong artistic vision  can shine through even if their work is  part of a trend Watchmen holds up  Sandman  holds up the max holds up I'll even go  to bat for the first few years of spawn  regardless of the trends but cream rises  to the top because it's not the trend  that is the problem it is the chasers  who aren't inherently drawn to the  material but instead want to cash in or  are being told to cash in by the people  who sign their checks they are the  problem so even if you want to call a  piece of woke media trend chasing  because honestly it may well be that  still won't be what makes it good or bad  so look beyond whatever trend you think  it's being pandered to to find actual  reasons that it doesn't work because if  it's actually bad they won't be that  hard to find but if all you've got to  fall back on is sjw agenda Lal then  maybe you don't actually have an  argument that's worth making and if you  feel like I'm calling you out please  take this to heart I'm not trying to  tell you to shut up I am challenging you  to back up your assertions because even  if I disagree with your conclusion if  you put in the work I can at least  respect that much there just doesn't  seem to be a lot of work being done and  it's the laziness and the lack of  self-reflection when I see these  arguments that annoys me more than  anything else and above all in comments  on Twitter and in life please just don't  be an act all hey everybody thanks for  watching I hope you will subscribe share  this video and of course feel free to  leave a comment I actually do enjoy  getting them just you know try and  formulate an actual argument if I'm  gonna try and disagree with me I also  have a patreon if you want to help the  channel grow into bigger and better  things there's other links in the  descriptions beside that for you to  check out but you also don't have to do  any of it cuz at the end of the day  you're the council  I'm just running the meeting and until  next time this council is adjourned  [Music]
 

